   { {"task-link", required_argument, NULL, OPTION_TASK_LINK},

       '\0', N_("SYMBOL"), N_("Do task level linking"), TWO_DASHES },

I tried to rebuild of binutils package,

install it, then Compaq C++ compiler works well now!

